From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:32:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Scale card on Health

Fork-added card (Spanish: Bascula) after Vitality on the Health screen:
newest reading date and time, weight with its change over ~7 and ~30 days
and a 30-day sparkline (the existing Sparkline component), then whichever of
body fat, lean mass, bone mass, body water and BMR the scale wrote. A metric
older than the headline day says 'as of <date>'. Masses follow the
metric/imperial preference; the time follows the clock-format setting.
With no scale data it explains the Samsung Health -> Health Connect -> NOOP
steps instead.

Hook: one item line in HealthScreen. Strings live in fork-only
strings_victor_scale.xml (English + Spanish).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
